---
<section>
  <div class="slide-content" style="background:#121212; width:100%; height:100%; overflow:hidden; font-family:'Inter',sans-serif;">
    <div style="position:relative; width:100%; height:100%; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center;">

      <div style="position:absolute; inset:0; background-image:linear-gradient(rgba(255,247,205,0.02) 1px, transparent 1px), linear-gradient(to right, rgba(255,247,205,0.02) 1px, transparent 1px); background-size:80px 80px;"></div>
      <div style="position:absolute; top:0; left:0; right:0; height:3px; background:linear-gradient(to right, transparent, #FFF7CD 50%, transparent);"></div>

      <!-- Número de slide (superior derecho) -->
      <div style="position:absolute; top:28px; right:48px; font-size:11px; color:rgba(167,159,142,0.3); font-weight:600; letter-spacing:0.15em;">12 / 15</div>

      <div style="position:relative; z-index:10; max-width:960px; width:100%; padding:0 64px;">

        <p style="font-size:11px; color:#FFF7CD; letter-spacing:0.25em; text-transform:uppercase; font-weight:600; margin:0 0 16px 0;">Microentorno · Entorno Inmediato</p>
        <h2 style="font-size:38px; font-weight:800; color:#FFF7CD; margin:0 0 32px 0; letter-spacing:-0.02em;">Actores del<br/><span style="color:#FAF0B5;">ecosistema</span></h2>

        <!-- Grid de actores -->
        <div style="display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(3, 1fr); gap:10px;">

          <div style="padding:20px; background:rgba(255,247,205,0.06); border:1px solid rgba(255,247,205,0.25);">
            <div style="font-size:11px; color:#FFF7CD; letter-spacing:0.15em; font-weight:600; margin-bottom:10px;">CLIENTES</div>
            <div style="font-size:14px; font-weight:600; color:#FFF7CD; margin-bottom:6px;">Escuelas ETP · PyMEs</div>
            <div style="font-size:12px; color:#a79f8e; line-height:1.5;">Priorizan soluciones locales en pesos frente al encarecimiento de licencias extranjeras</div>
          </div>

          <div style="padding:20px; background:rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border:1px solid rgba(255,247,205,0.15);">
            <div style="font-size:11px; color:#FAF0B5; letter-spacing:0.15em; font-weight:600; margin-bottom:10px;">PROVEEDORES</div>
            <div style="font-size:14px; font-weight:600; color:#FFF7CD; margin-bottom:6px;">Vercel · Render · Supabase</div>
            <div style="font-size:12px; color:#a79f8e; line-height:1.5;">Open source y planes gratuitos. Bajo poder de negociación sobre nosotros</div>
          </div>

          <div style="padding:20px; background:rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border:1px solid rgba(255,247,205,0.15);">
            <div style="font-size:11px; color:#FAF0B5; letter-spacing:0.15em; font-weight:600; margin-bottom:10px;">COMPETIDORES</div>
            <div style="font-size:14px; font-weight:600; color:#FFF7CD; margin-bottom:6px;">Agencias · Freelancers</div>
            <div style="font-size:12px; color:#a79f8e; line-height:1.5;">Mercado fragmentado. Diferenciamos con ingeniería sólida y metodología formal</div>
          </div>

          <div style="padding:20px; background:rgba(255,255,255,0.02); border:1px solid rgba(255,247,205,0.08);">
            <div style="font-size:11px; color:rgba(255,247,205,0.6); letter-spacing:0.15em; font-weight:600; margin-bottom:10px;">INTERMEDIARIOS</div>
            <div style="font-size:14px; font-weight:600; color:#FFF7CD; margin-bottom:6px;">Mercado Pago · Cloud</div>
            <div style="font-size:12px; color:#a79f8e; line-height:1.5;">Facilitan cobro y despliegue automatizado del software</div>
          </div>

          <div style="padding:20px; background:rgba(255,255,255,0.02); border:1px solid rgba(255,247,205,0.08);">
            <div style="font-size:11px; color:rgba(255,247,205,0.6); letter-spacing:0.15em; font-weight:600; margin-bottom:10px;">COMUNIDAD</div>
            <div style="font-size:14px; font-weight:600; color:#FFF7CD; margin-bottom:6px;">CESSI · CAME · Sysarmy</div>
            <div style="font-size:12px; color:#a79f8e; line-height:1.5;">Cámaras y comunidades que regulan y potencian el sector IT argentino</div>
          </div>

          <div style="padding:20px; background:rgba(255,247,205,0.04); border:1px solid rgba(255,247,205,0.18);">
            <div style="font-size:11px; color:#FFF7CD; letter-spacing:0.15em; font-weight:600; margin-bottom:10px;">CAUDEX</div>
            <div style="font-size:14px; font-weight:600; color:#FFF7CD; margin-bottom:6px;">4 devs · Decisión horizontal</div>
            <div style="font-size:12px; color:#a79f8e; line-height:1.5;">Ágiles, multidisciplinarios, con adaptación rápida a cambios de proyecto</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
